# panel fixture: the PAGE mode button leaves Step zoom
# manual: p015
# workflow: Step zoom exit
given step 3 5 on
at 0 ms press mode.step
at 200 ms click step(3,5)
at 400 ms release mode.step
at 1000 ms click mode.page
expect command SetMode mode=Page
expect commands 1
expect mode page
expect engine mode page
expect led step(3,5) = green steady
at 2000 ms click step(3,5)
expect command SetStep track=3 step=4 attr=Active value=0
expect engine step 3 5 active = false
expect led step(3,5) = off
